female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1410856005:0":{"text":"多少年了……吾之身躯终于得以舒展。是汝等手持肮脏武器的无鳞之辈，解开了吾之束缚吗？","source_cn":"多少年了……吾之身躯终于得以舒展。是汝等手持肮脏武器的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x826D169613F96CD3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1410856006:0":{"text":"无论出于怎样的理由，看在汝等将吾从那屈辱梦境中唤醒的份上，吾便赐予汝等知晓吾名的殊荣吧！","source_cn":"无论出于怎样的理由，看在汝等将吾从那屈辱梦境中唤醒的份...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9CE183566B79899B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1410856007:0":{"text":"吾乃渊底之火，岩晶之心，天空与大地的第三女，众星之姊妹——","source_cn":"吾乃渊底之火，岩晶之心，天空与大地的第三女，众星之姊妹——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5CF16763E5AB35C4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1410856008:0":{"text":"吾名——<style=\"highlight\">阿兹卡·夏</style>！","source_cn":"吾名——<style=highlight>阿兹卡·夏<...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB85AB10C54264C4C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1410856009:0":{"text":"和记载里一模一样啊……从星海来到伊索米亚的初始之龙，在万年前与赫托结下友谊……","source_cn":"和记载里一模一样啊……从星海来到伊索米亚的初始之龙，在...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0B89189E891EA6A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1410856010:0":{"text":"但你却诅咒我们矮人一族，使得我们再也无法使用魔法！","source_cn":"但你却诅咒我们矮人一族，使得我们再也无法使用魔法！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x753FA5A850484283","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1410856011:0":{"text":"呵，这味道！赫托的子民——这是你们应有的下场！","source_cn":"呵，这味道！赫托的子民——这是你们应有的下场！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAC3404A9409D4C8F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1410856012:0":{"text":"为什么！赫托和你不是挚友吗？","source_cn":"为什么！赫托和你不是挚友吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9EFCBB3EEAFD89F4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1410856013:0":{"text":"那贪婪的神明不配成为吾之友人！","source_cn":"那贪婪的神明不配成为吾之友人！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1B7C84C2D540AD0A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1410856014:0":{"text":"愚蠢而好战的诸神相争之时，吾喷吐火焰，帮助赫托锻造武器。","source_cn":"愚蠢而好战的诸神相争之时，吾喷吐火焰，帮助赫托锻造武器。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x098B73C3E20A7BAA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1410856015:0":{"text":"阴险而残忍的恶魔入侵之时，吾引领子嗣，与他共同驱逐外敌！","source_cn":"阴险而残忍的恶魔入侵之时，吾引领子嗣，与他共同驱逐外敌！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB3D28ABF702E8192","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1410856016:0":{"text":"可他并不满足！他剥下吾的鳞片炼成铠甲，削下吾的尖角磨成锐刺！","source_cn":"可他并不满足！他剥下吾的鳞片炼成铠甲，削下吾的尖角磨成锐刺！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x375C15D2D4A953E1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1410856017:0":{"text":"他以和平作为大义，蒙骗吾为之付出，愚蠢的吾那时候并未醒悟！","source_cn":"他以和平作为大义，蒙骗吾为之付出，愚蠢的吾那时候并未醒悟！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF9B632EDB183066A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1410856018:0":{"text":"直到吾战死的子嗣被他剥下皮囊，抽拔筋骨！吾尚未降世的子嗣，也被他击碎吸食！","source_cn":"直到吾战死的子嗣被他剥下皮囊，抽拔筋骨！吾尚未降世的子...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7CA031882B4E8724","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1410856019:0":{"text":"这是……真的吗……？赫托伤害过你……","source_cn":"这是……真的吗……？赫托伤害过你……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC7604E2D4AE08BE3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1410856020:0":{"text":"正是！吾终于识破了他的谎言，在他眼里，吾等只是工具！因此，吾要惩罚他的欺骗和暴行！","source_cn":"正是！吾终于识破了他的谎言，在他眼里，吾等只是工具！因...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB3DD3670